@raoulreinoso's first order of business in Boston is not to figure out the snow storm that's about to hit, it's TARGET 🤣 "it's just drizzling" - Miranda Priestly lollll 

Jk snow fall hit that evening and he was safe back in the hotel. But waaah it's been a while since we've gone overseas so the love and Target miss is intense haha. It's my happy place cos I remember my visits with mom. ❤️so at 6am yday Manila time I was alive, alert and ready to take on the Alabang Pasig Alabang route for Liana's game again haha. Happy to report ang aga aga ng away via Facetime😂 thanks Uls for being my live seller 🥰 tomorrow again?🤣

Should we do a haul when he gets home?😂

